{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for sectors and businesses, shared by the website and the data pipeline. `hs` lists HS code prefixes (2 or 4 digits); the longest matching prefix wins, so '8411' (jet engines) goes to aerospace even though '84' is machinery. Every HS chapter 01-99 must land in exactly one business. `products` are example names used only by the sample-data generator.",
  "_comment_naics": "`naics` lists industry codes (NAICS) whose jobs belong to a business or sector, separately for the U.S. (BLS QCEW codes) and Canada (Statistics Canada table 36-10-0713 codes). '-code' subtracts an industry; 'a|b' means use b if a is confidential. Sector `bea` lists BEA state-GDP line codes (table SAGDP2). BEA line 5 (forestry, fishing & related) is split between Agriculture and Forest Products in proportion to jobs.",
